{
 "regions": {
  "r1": {
   "type": "heading",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "TRANSLATION",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r2": {
   "type": "heading",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "NÎTIS'ATAK.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r3": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "I. Salutation to that peaceful Majesty whose form is pure",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "knowledge, infinite and unconditioned by space, time &c., and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "the principal means of knowing which is self-perception.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r4": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "2 She of whom I think ceaselessly is indifferent to me:",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "she yearns after another man, and he is attached to a third",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "person; while some other woman pines away for me: fie on",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "that woman, on him, and on the God of Love, as well as on",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "this woman and on me.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r5": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "3. An ignorant man can be pleased easily; a wise man",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "can be pursuaded the more easily; but, the God Brahmâ",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "himself will not be able to win over a man puffed up with a",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "grain of knowledge.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r6": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "4. One might forcibly take out a jewel from the midst of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "the jaws of a shark; one might cross even the sea, agitated",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "on account of a succession of waves rising high; one might",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "place on one’s head even an infuriated serpent as if it were",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "a flower; but one cannot please the heart of a perverse fool",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "( or the perverse mind of a fool ).",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r7": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "5. Sedulously pressing sand, one may get oil even from",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "it; a person parched with thirst may drink water even in a",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "mirage; roaming ( here and there ) a person may, perchance,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "find the horn of a hare; but no one will be able to propitiate",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "a confirmed blockhead.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r8": {
   "type": "translated_stanza",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "6. He who wishes to lead wicked men to the path of the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "good, with wise words that sprinkle nectar (as it were), tries",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "to bind an elephant with a tender lotus-stalk, or attempts",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  }
 },
